## Ejemplos con cURL

### Listar Becas

```bash
curl -X GET "https://api.comillas.edu/v1/becas?page=1&size=10" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer eyJ0eXAi..." \
  -H "Accept: application/json"
```

### Crear Beca

```bash
curl -X POST "https://api.comillas.edu/v1/becas" \
  -H "Authorization: Bearer eyJ0eXAi..." \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "codigo": "BECA-003",
    "nombre": "Nueva Beca",
    "importe": 2500.00,
    "fechaInicio": "2025-01-01",
    "fechaFin": "2025-06-30"
  }'
```

